      "lines": [
        "4. 再叙述一个定理."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "46 ▮ 定理. 每一条射线映射到与它的方向相同的射线的任",
        "一个位移是平移."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "▼ 证明. 设位移$F$将任意一条射线映射到与它的方向",
        "相同的射线. 在平面上取任意一点$A$，并用$A_1$表示在位移$F$",
        "下它的象: $A_1=F(A)$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "取与点$A$不同的任意一点",
        "$X$（图227）. 根据定理的条件，",
        "位移$F$将射线$AX$映射到以点",
        "$A_1$为始点且与它的方向相同"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "label": "图 227",
      "box": [
        850,
        914,
        355,
        229
      ],
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [],
      "id": "fig-227"
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "label": "图 227",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": true,
      "lines": [
        "图 227"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "的射线; 点$X$的象是这条射线上满足下列条件的点: $|AX|$",
        "$=|A_1X_1|$（$F$是位移）. 于是，如果$X_1=F(X)$，那么，$[AX)\\uparrow\\uparrow$",
        "$[A_1X_1)$，$|AX|=|A_1X_1|$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "所以在使点$A$映射到点$X$的平移下，点$A_1$映射到点$X_1$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "因而，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$|AA_1|=|XX_1|$ （定理$44_1$），",
        "$[AA_1)\\uparrow\\uparrow[XX_1)$ （定理$44_2$）."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "根据平移的定义，上式表明位移$F$是平移."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们开始论证这个命题时，假设$A_1\\ne A$. 对于$A_1=A$的",
        "情况，自己写出定理的证明. ▼"
      ]
    },
